<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC","Microsoft YaHei",Arial,sans-serif' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>S3：这 0.0041 的提升，是三个 seed 同向的</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#C7D8F2' }}>08 · Significance</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 22, paddingBottom: 54 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            只把 conv_width 从 32 改成 64，其余全部不动；三个 seed 逐一配对比较，不靠均值掩盖方差。
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 22, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 34 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 660, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Table
                    style={{ width: 660, height: 300 }}
                    defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 18, textAlign: 'left', color: '#1A2230' }}
                    defaultCellStyle={{
                        paddingLeft: 14,
                        paddingRight: 14,
                        border: {
                            bottom: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' },
                            top: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' },
                        },
                    }}
                    cells={[
                        [
                            { text: 'seed', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' } },
                            { text: 'base（w32 · 19,042）', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' } },
                            { text: 'w64（74,946）', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' } },
                            { text: '配对差值', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' } },
                        ],
                        ['0', '0.984404', '0.988956', { text: '+0.004552', textStyle: { color: '#D9534F', bold: true } }],
                        ['1', '0.984423', '0.988080', { text: '+0.003657', textStyle: { color: '#D9534F', bold: true } }],
                        ['2', '0.984785', '0.988898', { text: '+0.004113', textStyle: { color: '#D9534F', bold: true } }],
                        [
                            { text: '均值 ± std', textStyle: { bold: true } },
                            { text: '0.984537 ± 0.000215', textStyle: { bold: true } },
                            { text: '0.988645 ± 0.000490', textStyle: { bold: true } },
                            { text: '0.004107', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#D9534F' } },
                        ],
                    ]}
                />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 6 }}>
                    数据：results/repeats.csv，std 为样本标准差（ddof=1，n=3）
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 466, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 64, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>19×</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>差值 / base 标准差<br />3 个 seed 全部同向</Text>
                </Box>
                <Image src='assets/before_after.png' style={{ width: 330, height: 224, objectFit: 'contain', marginTop: 14 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>
                    图：base 与 w64 的三 seed 对比（figures/before_after.png）
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />

        <Box style={{ height: 52, background: '#E8EFF8', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 18, paddingRight: 18 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230' }}>
                「调参有效」这句话到此成立，但<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>只在一个天生偏弱的结构内部成立</span>——这个边界第 12 页给出了数字。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>MedMNIST 医学影像分类调参实验室 · 中期验收</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>08 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
